# Flask Docker App
 
A simple Python Flask web app containerized with Docker.

### Directory Structure 
    app.py 
    template/
      -index.html
    static/
      -style.css
---
 
### How to Run with Docker
 
### Build the Image
 
```bash
docker build -t flask-docker-app .

### Run the Docker Image

docker run -d -p 5000:5000 flask-docker-app


